$ grep -A8 "<export>" /opt/ros/noetic/share/nav_core_adapter/package.xml
  <export>
    <nav_core plugin="${prefix}/nav_core_plugins.xml"/>
    <nav_core2 plugin="${prefix}/nav_core2_plugins.xml"/>
  </export>
</package>

【plugins 命令语义说明】`rospack plugins --attrib=X PKG` 的语义是：从 PKG 出发沿**依赖闭包**（对照实测**不含自身**：navfn 自查亦空，而其 package.xml 明有 <export><nav_core .../></export>）中查找导出 X 标签的包。adapter 的 export 标签名为 nav_core / nav_core2（非裸 plugin），且其依赖闭包内无人导出 → 空输出为命令语义所致，**不是安装问题**。插件描述符权威来源 = share 下两个 XML 文件，全文如下（小张 C0 用 type 串）：

$ cat /opt/ros/noetic/share/nav_core_adapter/nav_core_plugins.xml
<class_libraries>
  <library path="lib/liblocal_planner_adapter">
    <class type="nav_core_adapter::LocalPlannerAdapter" base_class_type="nav_core::BaseLocalPlanner">
      <description></description>
    </class>
  </library>
  <library path="lib/libglobal_planner_adapter">
    <class type="nav_core_adapter::GlobalPlannerAdapter" base_class_type="nav_core::BaseGlobalPlanner">
      <description></description>
    </class>
  </library>
</class_libraries>

$ cat /opt/ros/noetic/share/nav_core_adapter/nav_core2_plugins.xml
<class_libraries>
  <library path="lib/libglobal_planner_adapter2">
    <class type="nav_core_adapter::GlobalPlannerAdapter2" base_class_type="nav_core2::GlobalPlanner">
      <description></description>
    </class>
  </library>
  <library path="lib/libcostmap_adapter">
    <class type="nav_core_adapter::CostmapAdapter" base_class_type="nav_core2::Costmap">
      <description></description>
    </class>
  </library>
</class_libraries>

【type 串清单（4 个）】
1. nav_core_adapter::LocalPlannerAdapter   ← base: nav_core::BaseLocalPlanner
2. nav_core_adapter::GlobalPlannerAdapter  ← base: nav_core::BaseGlobalPlanner
3. nav_core_adapter::GlobalPlannerAdapter2 ← base: nav_core2::GlobalPlanner
4. nav_core_adapter::CostmapAdapter        ← base: nav_core2::Costmap

